# Patterns to ignore when packaging the Helm chart.
# NOTE: deliberately does NOT exclude `charts/` or `*.tgz` — this monorepo
# vendors subcharts into charts/ at release time (`helm dependency build`), and
# excluding them here makes Helm report the deps as "missing" at load time.
# Git exclusion of vendored subcharts is handled by the repo-root .gitignore
# (`charts/*/charts/`, `charts/*/*.tgz`).
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.tmproj
*.bak
*.orig
*~
